# Web hostname tenancy

- Resolve club via `resolveClubFromHost()` / allowlist in `apps/web/src/lib/clubs/`.
- Use `apps/web/src/proxy.ts` (Next.js Proxy) to forward allowlisted host context headers.
- Normalize host: lowercase, strip port; map www and apex to the same slug.
- Unknown hosts → platform fallback or 404 — never another club’s `organizationId`.
- Public data fetching must use the resolved club’s org id/slug from the allowlist, not request body/query club ids alone.
- `generateMetadata` and canonical links use the club’s `primaryDomain`.
- Admin routes still require JWT + org membership; hostname only scopes UX.
